table sector if s_emp == 1 [pw=dwt], statistic(mean iw_poor_post_rel) statistic(frequency) nformat(%9.4f mean)
tab sector if s_iwp == 1 [aw=dwt]

*** H2: SMD rate by sector among IWP Employees (descriptive) and cell sizes
table sector if s_iwp == 1 [pw=dwt], statistic(mean smd) statistic(frequency) nformat(%9.4f mean)

*** H3: SMD by sector among IWP Employees, with M6 controls; joint test of sector
svy, subpop(s_iwp): logit smd i.sector i.year i.age_grp i.sex i.hh_type c.inc_rel i.educ3 i.region i.urban i.health_bad i.limit, or
testparm i.sector
margins sector, subpop(s_iwp) vce(unconditional)

*** H4: IWP risk by sector among employees (post), with year, age, sex, household type, education, region
svy, subpop(s_emp): logit iw_poor_post_rel i.sector i.year i.age_grp i.sex i.hh_type i.educ3 i.region i.urban, or
testparm i.sector
margins sector, subpop(s_emp) vce(unconditional)


